{"id": "34597", "title": "人在天涯", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 22, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34597/34597s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34597.htm", "intro": "志翔怀着梦想飞往罗马去投奔学声乐的哥哥，本想已功成名就的志远，必定在各大著名舞台上意兴风发地表演着歌剧，却不料，志远只是歌剧院内抬布景的杂工。真相一旦呈现，志翔顿时惭愧自己利用志远钱读着贵族般的学校，更深深感到人在天涯的悲恐......。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34597", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2198959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2198960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2198961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2198962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2198963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2198964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2198965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2198966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2198967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2198968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2198969.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2198970.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2198971.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2198972.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2198973.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16节", "file": "2198974.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17节", "file": "2198975.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18节", "file": "2198976.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19节", "file": "2198977.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20节", "file": "2198978.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第21节", "file": "2198979.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第后记", "file": "2198980.html", "available": true}]}